[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3781.52, "timestamp": "01:03:01", "text": "是啊，我是侦察队探索 队的。哦，对。他们还在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3784.319, "timestamp": "01:03:04", "text": "队的。哦，对。他们还在 老太太家。Sumi"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3788.95, "timestamp": "01:03:08", "text": "在那儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3790.47, "timestamp": "01:03:10", "text": "现在还有另一个人有空。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3792.63, "timestamp": "01:03:12", "text": "啊，那儿就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3796.15, "timestamp": "01:03:16", "text": "。我就打个“傻瓜”然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3804.309, "timestamp": "01:03:24", "text": "我觉得她没在直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3807.27, "timestamp": "01:03:27", "text": "不，我不在乎。我在那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3809.27, "timestamp": "01:03:29", "text": "个人的聊天室里打字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3811.75, "timestamp": "01:03:31", "text": "我的天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3813.349, "timestamp": "01:03:33", "text": "等等，还有谁在那儿？其实，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3814.309, "timestamp": "01:03:34", "text": "知道吗？让我看看。Areu在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3817.75, "timestamp": "01:03:37", "text": "那儿？Hanhan在那儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3819.829, "timestamp": "01:03:39", "text": "Araku是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3820.63, "timestamp": "01:03:40", "text": "你不知道？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3822.47, "timestamp": "01:03:42", "text": "如果我不知道的话，我会显得很没面子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3825.109, "timestamp": "01:03:45", "text": "。哦，不。等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3828.789, "timestamp": "01:03:48", "text": "你什么也没做。我不确定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3831.109, "timestamp": "01:03:51", "text": "我不记得了，伙计。我离开了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3833.43, "timestamp": "01:03:53", "text": "一个月，伙计。我不记得那些人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3835.91, "timestamp": "01:03:55", "text": "然后下面那个人也在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3837.589, "timestamp": "01:03:57", "text": "我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3839.75, "timestamp": "01:03:59", "text": 